        "The matrix is sparse: most entries are zero.  Real NLP matrices may have millions of documents and hundreds of thousands of vocabulary terms, so sparse storage is essential in practice.  Still, the dense representation is useful pedagogically.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Python example: cosine search from scratch\n",
        "\n",
        "Now we represent a query and rank the documents by cosine similarity."
